    "text_full": "Help Center\nLogin\nProduct\nSolutions\nResources\nAPI\nPlans & Pricing\nTry for Free\nRequest a Demo\nBranded eSignature Experience for every document\nStand out from the crowd and make your eSignatures unforgettable with ultra-customized branding options. Ready to own the entire signer experience?\nA signing experience that puts your brand center stage\nEnsure a consistent, recognizable brand experience throughout the entire end-to-end signing process with Signing Brands. Strengthen trust and professionalism with every document.\nShowcase Your Logo Directly Within Documents\n\nEmbed your logo within your documents to ensure every signature not only completes a transaction but also reinforces your brand’s professional image. Each document becomes a powerful brand ambassador, making your brand instantly recognizable.\n\nCustomize Emails and Notifications for a Polished Brand Experience\n\nMaintain a cohesive brand image by customizing all emails and notifications sent during the signing process. From the initial invitation to sign to the final confirmation, each message will reflect your brand’s unique style, enhancing the overall professionalism and trustworthiness of your communications.\n\nPersonalize the Signer Journey with Branded Links and URLs\n\nGuide your signers through a branded journey by redirecting them to a custom URL upon signing completion. This personalized touch not only creates a seamless experience but also provides an additional opportunity to engage with your brand and leave a lasting impression.\n\nReinforce Your Brand Identity with Every Interaction\n\nConsistency is key in building a strong brand identity. By integrating your brand into every interaction throughout the signing process, you ensure that your brand remains front and center, fostering recognition and trust with every document signed.\n\nTestimonials\nEducation\nAngelina B.\nSPED Coordinator\nLifesaver for Schools\nBlueink is very user-friendly. It is such a huge timesaver and allows our district to meet virtually and send and receive documents in real time. Users can also see when people have signed the documents, and who needs to sign with a reminder feature to resend the documents. I have no complaints about Blueink! All users are able to access the documents, sign them electronically, and receive a copy in a timely manner.\nEducation\nBette Jo T.\nAdministrative Assistant\nCustomer service is superior to Docusign\nUtilizing BlueInk has improved our department greatly! We are able to get necessary paperwork signed quickly and I love how BlueInk sends reminders when the forms are not signed. We can [also] send consent forms via BlueInk and get it signed that very same day. When using USPS, we might wait for months for the paperwork.\nEducation\nElizabeth B.\nDirector of Special Education\nExcellent product to obtain quick and easy signature\nI absolutely love this product and use it daily.\nEducation\nJason V.\nDirector of Work-Based Learning and Youth Apprenticeship Programs\nBLUEINK is the best solution that I have found for Digital Signatures in an Educational environment\nExceptional! I have told all of my colleagues about this program and am excited to present on it in the future; as it is a truly perfect fit for Work-Based Learning and Youth Apprenticeship Coordinators in Georgia!\nEducation\nJulie H.\nRecruiting\nVery impactful – bundling documents saves us money\nThe business problem we have solved is sending documents in a bundle. With our last company, we had to send individual documents, which was much more costly. Our experience [with Blueink] has been great.\nEducation\nJulie L\nHR Manager\nGrateful for this Product\nI especially like that I can obtain an electronic signature due to folks being at different locations. I also appreciate the tracking abilities. It is simply a quality product!!\nPick your plan\nBilled monthly\nBilled yearly\n\n*Save up to 40%\nStandard\n\nSimilar to DocuSign\nStandard plan - 40% less\n\n$15\nPER USER / PER MONTH\n\n$180 billed annually\n\nBuy Now\nStandard Plan includes:\n120 Envelopes / User / Year\n5 Templates / User\nBlueink Payments\nAuto Detect Fields\nReal-time audit trail\nSMS Pin / Selfie / ID Authentication\nCC Additional Recipients\nEmail / Chat Support\nBusiness Pro\n\nSimilar to DocuSign\nBusiness Pro plan - 25% less\n\n$30\nPER USER / PER MONTH\n\n$360 billed annually\n\nBuy Now\nAll Standard features, plus:\n1800 Envelopes / User / Year\n12 Templates / User\nSMS Delivery\nReminder Emails\nCustom Messaging\nAttachment Fields\nMOST POPULAR\nBlueink Unlimited\n\nSimilar to DocuSign\nProfessional Unlimited - 86% less\n\n$40\nPER USER / PER MONTH\n\n$480 billed annually\n\nBuy Now\nAll Business Pro features, plus:\nUnlimited Envelopes / User / Year\nUnlimited Templates\nTeams\nSigning Brands\nEnterprise\n\nAdvanced Solutions\n\n\n\nLet’s talk\nUNLIMITED USERS\nContact Sales\nOther benefits include:\n\nUnlimited Users\nUnlimited Templates\nBulk Send\nSmart Link Forms\nCustom Reporting\nCustomer Success Team\nAPI and Embedded Signing Access\n\nLooking for quote? Request a personalized quote from Blueink.\n\nAdvanced functionality at the best price\nFeature  name\nBlueink\nCompetitor\nCompetitor\nCompetitor\nPrice\n$15 / Per User\n$25 / Per User\n$14.99 / Per User\n$19 / Per User\nUsers\nUnlimited\nCost Per\nCost Per\nCost Per\nNo Overages Fees\nUnused Envelopes\nRollover\nExpire\nExpire\nExpire\nSupport, Training & Onboarding\nIncluded\nAdditional Cost\nAdditional Cost\nAdditional Cost\nUnlimited Envelope Plan\nCustomer Service\n4.8/5\n4.3/5\n4.5/5\n4.3/5\nFAQs\nWhat are Signing Brands?\n\nSigning Brands in Blueink enable you to create a custom signing experience for your signers by customizing the settings, logo, company name, and more for each brand.\n\n​Can I set a default signing brand?\n\nYes, you can set a default signing brand. For the account default, go to the account settings, navigate to the Envelope Defaults tab, and u